    DOUBLE-GRID(g=4,R=2)             n= 120 arbs= 24 BY PROPOSER COUNT {1: 8, 4: 16} (k_min=1, k_conflict=4); TOTAL arb share 1/5 (~0.2000); CONFLICT-arb share 2/15 (~0.1333); THIS RECORD'S APPLICABLE bound 1/(k_min+1) = 1/2; the all-k-proposer bound 1/(k_conflict+1) = 1/5   <== the TOTAL share equals it
    DOUBLE-GRID(g=4,R=3)             n= 160 arbs= 32 BY PROPOSER COUNT {1: 8, 4: 24} (k_min=1, k_conflict=4); TOTAL arb share 1/5 (~0.2000); CONFLICT-arb share 3/20 (~0.1500); THIS RECORD'S APPLICABLE bound 1/(k_min+1) = 1/2; the all-k-proposer bound 1/(k_conflict+1) = 1/5   <== the TOTAL share equals it
