    DGRID-INTERLEAVED(g=4,R=2)       n= 120 arbs= 24 BY PROPOSER COUNT {1: 8, 4: 16} (k_min=1, k_conflict=4); TOTAL arb share 1/5 (~0.2000); CONFLICT-arb share 2/15 (~0.1333); THIS RECORD'S APPLICABLE bound 1/(k_min+1) = 1/2; the all-k-proposer bound 1/(k_conflict+1) = 1/5   <== the TOTAL share equals it
    CONFLICT-GRID(g=4,R=4)           n= 116 arbs= 16 BY PROPOSER COUNT {4: 16} (k_min=4, k_conflict=4); TOTAL arb share 4/29 (~0.1379); CONFLICT-arb share 4/29 (~0.1379); THIS RECORD'S APPLICABLE bound 1/(k_min+1) = 1/5
