    THE UNFILLED SUCCESSOR CENSUS (the pin's K-II ask, reported whichever outcome fires): for every ARBITRATION of the headline record, how much of its own SUM_y b(y) budget the chart actually realizes at d = 2:
      16 conflict arbitrations: 15 REALIZE THEIR WHOLE SUM_y b(y) BUDGET (|D(2)| = SUM_y b(y), including the ones whose budget is itself small), 1 FALL SHORT of it, and 3 ATTAIN THE CEILING k^2 = 16.  The three counts are different questions and are reported separately.
