      THE SHORTFALLS, CHARACTERISED: the arbitrations that do not realize SUM_y b(y) have successor height offsets in [(2,)] — a chart counts only directions at EXACTLY height + 2, so a successor that skips a layer (offset >= 2) contributes its own successors at height + 3 or beyond and nothing at depth 2.  Where every successor sits at offset 1 the whole budget is realized.

    ROUND-1 MAJOR 2(b), THE OTHER WIDTH COLUMNS, PRINTED BESIDE THE max.  `max |D|` is the ONLY column on which the k = 4 record touches the sprinkling population at d = 2.  Its mean chart is 2.09 directions against the sprinklings' 3.26-6.41; its homogeneity 0.4083 and its |D| >= 4 0.2667 are BELOW both d = 2 bands, whole and interior; and 3 events of 120 carry the 16-wide chart.  The claim the measurement supports is about the MAXIMUM, at ONE depth, at ONE k.
