cord in band at d = 3: homogeneity ['DOUBLE-GRID(g=4,R=4)'], |D|>=4 ['DOUBLE-GRID(g=4,R=4)'], BOTH COLUMNS ['DOUBLE-GRID(g=4,R=4)']; in BOTH columns AND 16 wide = ['DOUBLE-GRID(g=4,R=4)']; flagship DOUBLE-GRID(g=4,R=4) d3 homog 29/40 in (Fraction(41, 60), Fraction(49, 60)), d3 |D|>=4 127/200 in (Fraction(3, 5), Fraction(91, 120)), max|D| 16/16; the headline's INTERIOR is in the d3 homogeneity band (3/4) and BELOW the d3 |D|>=4 band (47/80 vs (Fraction(3, 5), Fraction(91, 120))); monotone in R (whole True, interior True); the g = 3 anchor DOUBLE-GRID(3,4) d = 3 homogeneity 47/60 [IN ] and |D|>=4 13/40 [below] with max |D| = 9)

